    "type": "question",
    "label": "13",
    "prompt": "Consider $(1+x)^{2n}=(1+x)^n(1+x)^n$. Show that\n$$\\binom{2n}{n}=\\binom{n}{0}^{2}+\\binom{n}{1}^{2}+\\cdots+\\binom{n}{n}^{2}.$$",
